<p>The target has a 8% chance (stacking to a maximum of <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">41%, 51%, 57%, 62%, 65%</acronym>) to fail to cast any spell.  At level 2 magical effects may be disrupted, at level 3 magical sustains may be disrupted, and at level 5 magical constructs and undead may be stunned.</p>